0.35 | rel.\ error | Modulational-instability growth rate $\Gamma$ versus the $ZZ$ strength
$\epsilon$ (carrier $\omega_0=0.6206J$, sideband $K=\pi/13$, $N=12$).
``Sim.'' is the lattice mean-field (Hartree) emulation of the spin model;
``PDE'' is the NLSE prediction, Eq.~ .  The unextended $H_0$
baseline shows no growth.  The full-Hilbert-space statevector emulation
exhibits the same instability;

